# 2026-05-07 (NORA #28) — build outputs are now committed on version-15
# so instances can pull a working frontend without rebuilding on prod
# (vite needs ~3 GB heap and OOM-killed on 4 GB Neoffice tenants).
# Re-ignore both paths if you reintroduce a CI-only build flow on a
# branch that should NOT carry artifacts.
